Test rg38 (XFAIL): an initialized table lands on used words -- must fail
// A table WITHOUT an initializer reserves its words through setBits(),
// which checks them; a table WITH one emits a word per element, and each
// must be marked too. rg35_xfail_table_over is not this case: it
// is a table running past the end of a bank.
100/
    cli
    cma
100/
table 2, 7
stop
